  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">GLOBAL INVESTMENT PROGRAM FOR DEVELOPMENT OF THE WESTERN PORTION OF THE PICHINCHA PROVINCE. THE PROGRAM CONSISTS OF INVESTMENTS IN ROADS, THE PRODUCTIVE SECTORS, URBAN DEVELOPMENT FORESTRY AND ENVIRONMENTAL PROTECTION IN WESTERN PICHINCHA PROVINCE OF APPROXIMATELY 875,000 ACRES.</narrative>
